window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-061.json",{"day":61,"title":"What Makes a Neighborhood Cooler?","targetWords":[{"word":"normal","gloss":"正常的","context":"The team found that a fine design on paper mattered less than whether people could maintain it as part of their normal lives.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"warm","gloss":"温暖","context":"The primary question seemed ordinary: why did one block feel warm while another became dangerously hot?","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"particular","gloss":"特定的","context":"A shopkeeper on one particular busy street noted that narrow pavements forced pedestrians into direct sunlight.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"slow","gloss":"慢的","context":"Progress was slow, and one especially hot week tested everyone's patience.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"deep","gloss":"深的","context":"A former gardener explained how deep soil helped trees survive dry periods, while an engineer described the heavy burden that air conditioning placed on the electricity system.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"wide","gloss":"广泛的","context":"The team proposed wide planting areas where possible, active support from local volunteers, and appropriate species for each location.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"due","gloss":"应支付的","context":"Roots needed proper room, and maintenance costs were due long after the formal opening ceremony.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"specific","gloss":"具体的","context":"The team prepared a specific plan for measurements and asked residents to keep a regular diary of their experience.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"significant","gloss":"有意义的","context":"Instead of rejecting unusual ideas, researchers tested whether they described significant patterns that their initial survey had missed.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"multiple","gloss":"多种多样的","context":"The work required multiple kinds of knowledge.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"practical","gloss":"实际的","context":"They wanted a practical account of actual conditions rather than an ideal picture built only from computer models.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"heavy","gloss":"重的","context":"A former gardener explained how deep soil helped trees survive dry periods, while an engineer described the heavy burden that air conditioning placed on the electricity system.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"complex","gloss":"复杂的","context":"A quick walk revealed an obvious difference in shade, but the exact explanation was more complex.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"exact","gloss":"确切的","context":"A quick walk revealed an obvious difference in shade, but the exact explanation was more complex.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"ready","gloss":"准备好的","context":"Residents were ready to help, but the plan could not depend on unpaid labor alone.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"obvious","gloss":"明显的","context":"A quick walk revealed an obvious difference in shade, but the exact explanation was more complex.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"regular","gloss":"定期的","context":"The team prepared a specific plan for measurements and asked residents to keep a regular diary of their experience.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"appropriate","gloss":"恰当的","context":"The team proposed wide planting areas where possible, active support from local volunteers, and appropriate species for each location.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"unique","gloss":"独特的","context":"Each participant brought a unique perspective, and the team gave their observations equal attention.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"equal","gloss":"平等的","context":"Each participant brought a unique perspective, and the team gave their observations equal attention.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"overall","gloss":"全面的","context":"Nevertheless, the overall strategy began to produce results.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"former","gloss":"以前的","context":"A former gardener explained how deep soil helped trees survive dry periods, while an engineer described the heavy burden that air conditioning placed on the electricity system.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"round","gloss":"圆的","context":"Some comments sounded strange at first, including a suggestion that the shape of a round courtyard changed afternoon airflow.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"hot","gloss":"热的","context":"The primary question seemed ordinary: why did one block feel warm while another became dangerously hot?","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"ideal","gloss":"理想的","context":"They wanted a practical account of actual conditions rather than an ideal picture built only from computer models.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"impossible","gloss":"不可能的","context":"The researchers admitted that perfect comfort was impossible under every condition.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"primary","gloss":"首要的","context":"The primary question seemed ordinary: why did one block feel warm while another became dangerously hot?","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"quick","gloss":"迅速的","context":"A quick walk revealed an obvious difference in shade, but the exact explanation was more complex.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"fair","gloss":"公平的","context":"A fair division of responsibilities was necessary if the new landscape was to remain healthy after the excitement of construction had faded.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"formal","gloss":"正式的","context":"Roots needed proper room, and maintenance costs were due long after the formal opening ceremony.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"perfect","gloss":"完美的","context":"The researchers admitted that perfect comfort was impossible under every condition.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"strange","gloss":"奇怪的","context":"Some comments sounded strange at first, including a suggestion that the shape of a round courtyard changed afternoon airflow.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"fine","gloss":"好的","context":"The team found that a fine design on paper mattered less than whether people could maintain it as part of their normal lives.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"active","gloss":"活跃的","context":"The team proposed wide planting areas where possible, active support from local volunteers, and appropriate species for each location.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"busy","gloss":"忙碌的","context":"A shopkeeper on one particular busy street noted that narrow pavements forced pedestrians into direct sunlight.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"fresh","gloss":"新种的","context":"Officials initially wanted a rapid solution, but planting trees was not as simple as placing fresh seedlings wherever space appeared sufficient.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"routine","gloss":"常规","context":"An efficient watering routine was fundamental to success.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"sufficient","gloss":"足够的","context":"Officials initially wanted a rapid solution, but planting trees was not as simple as placing fresh seedlings wherever space appeared sufficient.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"actual","gloss":"实在的","context":"They wanted a practical account of actual conditions rather than an ideal picture built only from computer models.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"proper","gloss":"正确的","context":"Roots needed proper room, and maintenance costs were due long after the formal opening ceremony.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"efficient","gloss":"有效的","context":"An efficient watering routine was fundamental to success.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"narrow","gloss":"狭窄的","context":"A shopkeeper on one particular busy street noted that narrow pavements forced pedestrians into direct sunlight.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"dry","gloss":"干燥的","context":"A former gardener explained how deep soil helped trees survive dry periods, while an engineer described the heavy burden that air conditioning placed on the electricity system.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"fundamental","gloss":"基础的","context":"An efficient watering routine was fundamental to success.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"capable","gloss":"有能力的","context":"Temporary shelters provided only limited relief, although they were capable of protecting some vulnerable visitors.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"ordinary","gloss":"普通的","context":"The primary question seemed ordinary: why did one block feel warm while another became dangerously hot?","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"final","gloss":"最终的","context":"The final report recommended a broader approach to urban adaptation.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"rapid","gloss":"快的","context":"Officials initially wanted a rapid solution, but planting trees was not as simple as placing fresh seedlings wherever space appeared sufficient.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"widespread","gloss":"遍布的","context":"Widespread improvements would require cooperation across departments rather than a single impressive project.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"independent","gloss":"独立的","context":"A neighborhood facing hotter summers invited an independent research team to examine its streets.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"A neighborhood facing hotter summers invited an independent research team to examine its streets. The primary question seemed ordinary: why did one block feel warm while another became dangerously hot? A quick walk revealed an obvious difference in shade, but the exact explanation was more complex. Building materials, traffic, and the width of a road all influenced temperatures. The team prepared a specific plan for measurements and asked residents to keep a regular diary of their experience. They wanted a practical account of actual conditions rather than an ideal picture built only from computer models.","zh":"面对越来越炎热的夏季，社区邀请独立研究团队考察街道。首要问题很普通：为什么一个街区温暖，另一个却热得危险？短暂步行显示阴影明显不同，但确切解释更复杂，材料、交通与道路宽度都有影响。团队制定具体测量方案，请居民定期记日记，期待了解实际情况，而不是仅靠模型构造理想图景。"},{"en":"The work required multiple kinds of knowledge. A former gardener explained how deep soil helped trees survive dry periods, while an engineer described the heavy burden that air conditioning placed on the electricity system. A shopkeeper on one particular busy street noted that narrow pavements forced pedestrians into direct sunlight. Each participant brought a unique perspective, and the team gave their observations equal attention. Some comments sounded strange at first, including a suggestion that the shape of a round courtyard changed afternoon airflow. Instead of rejecting unusual ideas, researchers tested whether they described significant patterns that their initial survey had missed.","zh":"工作需要多种知识。以前的园丁解释深土怎样帮助树木度过干旱，工程师说明空调给电力系统带来的重负，某条繁忙街道的店主指出狭窄人行道让行人直晒。每人的独特观察都受到平等重视。有些意见最初听来奇怪，如圆形庭院会改变午后气流。研究者不直接排斥，而是检验它们是否说明了初步调查遗漏的重要规律。"},{"en":"Officials initially wanted a rapid solution, but planting trees was not as simple as placing fresh seedlings wherever space appeared sufficient. Roots needed proper room, and maintenance costs were due long after the formal opening ceremony. An efficient watering routine was fundamental to success. The team proposed wide planting areas where possible, active support from local volunteers, and appropriate species for each location. Residents were ready to help, but the plan could not depend on unpaid labor alone. A fair division of responsibilities was necessary if the new landscape was to remain healthy after the excitement of construction had faded.","zh":"官员起初想迅速解决，但种树不只是哪里看似有空就放新苗。树根需合适空间，正式启用很久后仍要支付维护费。高效浇水惯例是成功基础。团队建议尽量留宽种植区、发动志愿者，并选适当树种。居民愿意帮忙，方案却不能仅靠无偿劳动。只有公平分担责任，施工热潮过去后新绿地才可能健康。"},{"en":"Progress was slow, and one especially hot week tested everyone's patience. Temporary shelters provided only limited relief, although they were capable of protecting some vulnerable visitors. The researchers admitted that perfect comfort was impossible under every condition. Nevertheless, the overall strategy began to produce results. A primary school opened its shaded playground after lessons, and a shop supplied drinking water. These changes were not dramatic, but they kept daily movement manageable. The team found that a fine design on paper mattered less than whether people could maintain it as part of their normal lives.","zh":"进展缓慢，特别炎热的一周考验耐心。临时遮蔽物只能有限缓解，但确能保护部分脆弱访客。研究者承认不可能在所有条件下实现完美舒适，不过整体策略开始见效：小学课后开放阴凉操场，店铺提供饮水。这些变化不戏剧化，却让日常出行容易些。图纸上的好设计，不如人们能否在正常生活中持续维护它重要。"},{"en":"The final report recommended a broader approach to urban adaptation. Its most useful conclusion was that heat was not merely a weather issue. It affected independence, sleep, income, and the ability to use public space. Widespread improvements would require cooperation across departments rather than a single impressive project. The neighborhood had not eliminated hot days, but it had learned to recognize who suffered most and why. That knowledge turned a technical study into a shared public responsibility. When residents and researchers work together, ordinary observations can become reliable evidence for changes that make a place more livable.","zh":"最终报告建议更广泛的城市适应方式。最有用的结论是，炎热不只是天气问题，还影响独立生活、睡眠、收入与公共空间使用。广泛改善需要部门合作，而非单个耀眼项目。社区没消灭热天，却学会识别谁受害最多及原因。这让技术研究成为共同公共责任；居民与研究者合作，普通观察就能成为改善宜居性的可靠证据。"}],"previous":60,"next":62});
